  "summary": "图片上一个可拖动的裁剪框：框内拖动改位置、四角手柄拉大小，框外压暗、框内三分线，框上实时显示裁剪尺寸，底部取消 / 应用；初始居中约为图片 60%。",
  "usage": "头像、封面、商品图这类上传后需要裁成固定比例的图片编辑；桌面与触屏都可用。",
  "caution": "需要旋转、滤镜等完整编辑能力时用专业图片编辑器；移动端只做简单裁剪时四角手柄要放大到 ≥44px 命中区。",
  "hint": "拖动框内移动位置，拖四角手柄改大小，再点应用",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [],
  "prompt": "【图片裁剪框 Image Crop】目标：一张图片上叠一个可拖拽的裁剪框——框内拖动改位置，四角手柄拉伸尺寸（限制最小边长、不能拖出图片外），框外压暗、框内画三分线，框上方一个小标签实时显示裁剪尺寸，底部「取消 / 应用」。**初始裁剪框必须居中，尺寸约为图片的 60%**。\n\n1) 结构：body flex 列、居中、padding 8。.card（宽 min(320px,100%)、圆角 13、padding 8 10、底色 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg))、描边 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)、纵向 flex gap 6）：\n① .stage（position:relative、height 112、圆角 8、overflow:hidden、touch-action:none、user-select:none）——图片容器；\n② .photo（absolute inset 0）——用纯 CSS 画照片感：`radial-gradient` 两团暖色/主色光斑 + `linear-gradient(160deg,...)` 主渐变，再用 `::after` 画一层底部山形剪影（`clip-path:polygon(...)` + 渐变），**不引用任何外部图片**；\n③ .crop（absolute、left/top/width/height 由 JS 写内联、`border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 96%,transparent)`、圆角 2、cursor:move、transition box-shadow .2s）；框外压暗用 **`box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent)`**；框内三分线用 `.crop::after` 叠两层 `linear-gradient` 线 + `background-size:33.333% 33.333%`；\n④ .size（absolute、left 50%、top -17、translateX(-50%)、padding 0 5、圆角 4、底 color-mix(text 82%)、字 var(--ui-bg)、8px 600、tabular-nums、pointer-events:none）——实时尺寸；\n⑤ 四个 .handle（absolute、12×12、圆角 3、底 var(--ui-bg)、`box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--ui-brand)`；br 在右下 -6 处、tl/tr/bl 同理；cursor nwse/nesw-resize；弹窗里用 `::after{inset:-11px}` 扩到 ≥44px 命中区）；\n⑥ .foot（flex、左 .ratio 文字「裁剪框 320 × 240」+ 右两个按钮：取消 ghost、应用 brand，高 20 / 9px）。\n\n2) 状态与初始位置：`box = {x, y, w, h}`（stage 像素）。**初始：`w = round(stageW * 0.60)`、`h = round(stageH * 0.60)`、`x = round((stageW - w)/2)`、`y = round((stageH - h)/2)`——必须居中**。显示尺寸按 2 倍图换算：`Math.round(w*2) + ' × ' + Math.round(h*2)`，同时写进框上 .size 和底部 .ratio。最小边长 `MIN = 34`。\n\n3) **首帧尺寸守卫（本设计踩过的坑）**：iframe 首帧 `stage.clientWidth/clientHeight` 可能是 0，若此时就 reset，框会变成 0×0 且不再重算（看起来就是「偏/空」）。所以 `reset(tries)` 里先判断 `if((!s.w || !s.h) && tries < 60) requestAnimationFrame(function(){ reset(tries+1); });`，最多重试 60 帧；另外监听 window resize 时只 `paint()` 保持比例。\n\n4) 拖拽（Pointer Events）：crop 上 `pointerdown`（若目标是 .handle 则跳过）→ `beginDrag(ev,'move')`：记录 `dragStart = {px, py, box 快照}`、加 .dragging、`setPointerCapture`、`preventDefault()`；`pointermove` 按模式计算：\n- move：`x = clamp(b.x+dx, 0, stageW-b.w)`、`y` 同理；\n- br：`w = clamp(b.w+dx, MIN, stageW-b.x)`、h 同理；\n- tl：左上角移动时同时改 x/y/w/h（w = b.w + (b.x - 新x)，被 MIN 与边界夹住）；\n- tr / bl：同理混合。\n每次 move 后 `paint()`。`pointerup/pointercancel` → endDrag（清模式、移除 .dragging）。**不要用 CSS transition 追指针**。\n\n5) 按钮：取消 → 重置到居中初始框；应用 → 给 crop 加 .applied（success 描边 + 3px 光环）1 秒后移除；两按钮按下 scale(.95)。\n\n6) 无障碍：四个手柄是 button + aria-label（左上角缩放 等）；应用/取消是原生 button；指针事件用 pointerdown/move/up 一套代码覆盖鼠标与触屏。\n\n7) 坑：①框外压暗用一条超大 box-shadow（父级 overflow:hidden 裁掉超出部分）而不是四个遮罩 div，也不会挡住手柄；②手柄要 `stopPropagation`，否则同时触发框的 move；③拖动必须 `touch-action:none` + `preventDefault`；④`MIN` 要大于手柄直径；⑤尺寸显示用 2 倍图换算；⑥**reset 必须处理首帧 0 尺寸**，否则初始框显示不对（本轮用户反馈的「偏」就是它）。\n\n8) 配色（宿主变量）：--ui-bg 画布/手柄方块/尺寸标签文字、--ui-surface 卡片、--ui-surface-2 次级表面、--ui-border 分隔线、--ui-text 正文/遮罩混合色、--ui-text-dim 比例说明、--ui-brand 手柄描边/拖动高亮边框、--ui-success 应用态与照片渐变、--ui-warn 照片光斑。\n\n9) 弹窗初始态（740×733，交互模式）：图片区 420 高、裁剪框**居中**（60% 尺寸）、尺寸标签可见，即目标态。\n\n10) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；首轮延迟 0.3 秒；一轮 = 复位居中 → 光标按住框中心拖 (+18,+10)（620ms rAF，光标跟随）→ 释放 → 320ms 后按住右下角手柄拉伸 (+34,+22)（620ms）→ 释放 → 500ms 后点「应用」（按下 0.18 秒，框变 success 描边 1 秒）→ 500ms 后 cursor.hide()、1.2 秒后复位；间隔 7.2 秒。\n\n11) 小视口（高度 ≤420）：body padding 6、卡片 padding 7 9 / gap 5、stage 108 高。放大弹窗（高度 ≥421）：卡片宽 min(460px,100%)、padding 20 22 / gap 14、stage **420** 高 / 圆角 14、边框 2px、尺寸标签 13px（top -26）、手柄 22×22（`::after inset:-11px` 扩命中区）、按钮高 34 / 14px。\n\n12) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px}\n\n.card{width:min(320px,100%);margin:0 auto;background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:13px;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.stage{position:relative;height:112px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,var(--ui-bg));touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.photo{position:absolute;inset:0;background:\n  radial-gradient(circle at 26% 30%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-warn) 55%,transparent),transparent 55%),\n  radial-gradient(circle at 74% 22%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 35%,transparent),transparent 50%),\n  linear-gradient(160deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,var(--ui-bg)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 40%,var(--ui-bg)) 68%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 45%,var(--ui-bg)))}\n.photo::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:46%;background:linear-gradient(to top,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),transparent);clip-path:polygon(0 62%,18% 34%,34% 58%,52% 22%,70% 52%,86% 30%,100% 58%,100% 100%,0 100%)}\n\n.crop{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:0;height:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 1.5px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 92%,transparent) inset;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 96%,transparent);border-radius:2px;cursor:move;touch-action:none;transition:box-shadow .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}\n.crop::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 46%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(to bottom,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 46%,transparent) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:33.333% 33.333%;opacity:.7}\n.crop.dragging{border-color:var(--ui-brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,transparent)}\n.crop.applied{border-color:var(--ui-success);box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 55%,transparent),0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-success) 45%,transparent)}\n\n.size{position:absolute;left:50%;top:-17px;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:0 5px;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 82%,transparent);color:var(--ui-bg);font-size:8px;line-height:13px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none}\n.handle{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:3px;background:var(--ui-bg);box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--ui-brand);cursor:nwse-resize;touch-action:none}\n.handle.br{right:-6px;bottom:-6px}\n.handle.tl{left:-6px;top:-6px;cursor:nwse-resize}\n.handle.tr{right:-6px;top:-6px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.handle.bl{left:-6px;bottom:-6px;cursor:nesw-resize}\n.handle:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 60%,transparent);outline-offset:2px}\n\n.foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.ratio{font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);flex:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.ratio b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600}\n.btn{height:20px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:5px;font:inherit;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s ease,background .12s ease,opacity .15s ease}\n.btn.pressing{transform:scale(.95)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.btn.ghost:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,var(--ui-bg));color:var(--ui-text)}\n.btn.ok{background:var(--ui-brand);border:0;color:var(--ui-bg)}\n.btn.ok:hover{opacity:.92}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:6px}\n  .card{padding:7px 9px;gap:5px}\n  .stage{height:108px}\n}\n\n/* 放大弹窗（740×733）：大图 + 大框 + 大手柄（44px 命中区） */\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  body{padding:40px}\n  .card{width:min(460px,100%);padding:20px 22px;gap:14px;border-radius:18px}\n  .stage{height:420px;border-radius:14px}\n  .crop{border-width:2px}\n  .crop::after{background-image:linear-gradient(to right,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 40%,transparent) 2px,transparent 2px),linear-gradient(to bottom,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 40%,transparent) 2px,transparent 2px)}\n  .size{font-size:13px;line-height:20px;padding:0 8px;top:-26px;border-radius:6px}\n  .handle{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2.5px var(--ui-brand)}\n  .handle.br{right:-11px;bottom:-11px}\n  .handle.tl{left:-11px;top:-11px}\n  .handle.tr{right:-11px;top:-11px}\n  .handle.bl{left:-11px;bottom:-11px}\n  .handle::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-11px}\n  .foot{gap:10px}\n  .ratio{font-size:13px}\n  .btn{height:34px;padding:0 16px;font-size:14px;border-radius:8px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .crop,.btn{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n    <div class=\"photo\"></div>\n    <div class=\"crop\" id=\"crop\">\n      <span class=\"size\" id=\"size\">320 × 240</span>\n      <button class=\"handle tl\" type=\"button\" data-corner=\"tl\" aria-label=\"左上角缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle tr\" type=\"button\" data-corner=\"tr\" aria-label=\"右上角缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle bl\" type=\"button\" data-corner=\"bl\" aria-label=\"左下角缩放\"></button>\n      <button class=\"handle br\" type=\"button\" data-corner=\"br\" aria-label=\"右下角缩放\"></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot\">\n    <span class=\"ratio\">裁剪框 <b id=\"sizeText\">320 × 240</b></span>\n    <button class=\"btn ghost\" id=\"cancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n    <button class=\"btn ok\" id=\"apply\" type=\"button\">应用</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var card = document.getElementById('card'),\n      stage = document.getElementById('stage'),\n      crop = document.getElementById('crop'),\n      sizeEl = document.getElementById('size'),\n      sizeText = document.getElementById('sizeText'),\n      cancelBtn = document.getElementById('cancel'),\n      applyBtn = document.getElementById('apply');\n\n  var SCALE = 2;           /* 显示尺寸按 2 倍图换算 */\n  var MIN = 34;            /* 最小裁剪边长（stage 像素） */\n  var box = { x: 0, y: 0, w: 0, h: 0 };\n  var mode = null;         /* move | tl | tr | bl | br */\n  var dragStart = null;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null, rafId = 0;\n\n  function stageSize(){\n    return { w: stage.clientWidth, h: stage.clientHeight };\n  }\n  function clamp(v, lo, hi){ return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, v)); }\n\n  function paint(){\n    crop.style.left = box.x + 'px';\n    crop.style.top = box.y + 'px';\n    crop.style.width = box.w + 'px';\n    crop.style.height = box.h + 'px';\n    var label = Math.round(box.w * SCALE) + ' × ' + Math.round(box.h * SCALE);\n    sizeEl.textContent = label;\n    sizeText.textContent = label;\n  }\n\n  /* 初始居中：尺寸为图片的 60%；若首帧 stage 还没布局（0 尺寸）就等下一帧重算 */\n  function reset(tries){\n    tries = tries || 0;\n    var s = stageSize();\n    if((!s.w || !s.h) && tries < 60){\n      requestAnimationFrame(function(){ reset(tries + 1); });\n      return;\n    }\n    box.w = Math.round(s.w * 0.60);\n    box.h = Math.round(s.h * 0.60);\n    box.x = Math.round((s.w - box.w) / 2);\n    box.y = Math.round((s.h - box.h) / 2);\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  function beginDrag(ev, m){\n    if(!ev) return;\n    mode = m;\n    dragStart = { px: ev.clientX, py: ev.clientY, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n    crop.classList.add('dragging');\n    try { crop.setPointerCapture(ev.pointerId); } catch(e){ /* 忽略 */ }\n    ev.preventDefault();\n  }\n\n  function moveDrag(clientX, clientY){\n    if(!mode || !dragStart) return;\n    var s = stageSize();\n    var dx = clientX - dragStart.px, dy = clientY - dragStart.py;\n    var b = dragStart.box;\n    if(mode === 'move'){\n      box.x = clamp(b.x + dx, 0, s.w - b.w);\n      box.y = clamp(b.y + dy, 0, s.h - b.h);\n    } else if(mode === 'br'){\n      box.w = clamp(b.w + dx, MIN, s.w - b.x);\n      box.h = clamp(b.h + dy, MIN, s.h - b.y);\n    } else if(mode === 'tl'){\n      var nx = clamp(b.x + dx, 0, b.x + b.w - MIN);\n      var ny = clamp(b.y + dy, 0, b.y + b.h - MIN);\n      box.x = nx; box.y = ny;\n      box.w = b.w + (b.x - nx);\n      box.h = b.h + (b.y - ny);\n    } else if(mode === 'tr'){\n      var ny2 = clamp(b.y + dy, 0, b.y + b.h - MIN);\n      box.y = ny2;\n      box.h = b.h + (b.y - ny2);\n      box.w = clamp(b.w + dx, MIN, s.w - b.x);\n    } else if(mode === 'bl'){\n      var nx2 = clamp(b.x + dx, 0, b.x + b.w - MIN);\n      box.x = nx2;\n      box.w = b.w + (b.x - nx2);\n      box.h = clamp(b.h + dy, MIN, s.h - b.y);\n    }\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  function endDrag(){\n    if(!mode) return;\n    mode = null;\n    dragStart = null;\n    crop.classList.remove('dragging');\n  }\n\n  crop.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(ev){\n    if(ev.target && ev.target.classList && ev.target.classList.contains('handle')) return;\n    beginDrag(ev, 'move');\n  });\n  [].slice.call(crop.querySelectorAll('.handle')).forEach(function(h){\n    h.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(ev){\n      ev.stopPropagation();\n      beginDrag(ev, h.getAttribute('data-corner'));\n    });\n  });\n  crop.addEventListener('pointermove', function(ev){ moveDrag(ev.clientX, ev.clientY); });\n  crop.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\n  crop.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\n\n  cancelBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ reset(); });\n  applyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    crop.classList.add('applied');\n    setTimeout(function(){ crop.classList.remove('applied'); }, 1000);\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function pressEl(c, el, done){\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      el.classList.add('dragging');\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        el.classList.remove('dragging');\n        done();\n      }, 180);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function dragBy(c, dx, dy, dur, done){\n    var s = stageSize();\n    var cx = s.w / 2, cy = s.h / 2;\n    var sr = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    c.at(sr.left + cx, sr.top + cy);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      crop.classList.add('dragging');\n      mode = 'move';\n      dragStart = { px: sr.left + cx, py: sr.top + cy, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        moveDrag(dragStart.px + dx * e, dragStart.py + dy * e);\n        var gr = crop.getBoundingClientRect();\n        c.at(gr.left + gr.width / 2, gr.top + gr.height / 2);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else { mode = null; dragStart = null; crop.classList.remove('dragging'); c.release(); if(done) done(); }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function resizeBy(c, dx, dy, dur, done){\n    var br = crop.querySelector('.handle.br');\n    var gr0 = br.getBoundingClientRect();\n    c.at(gr0.left + gr0.width / 2, gr0.top + gr0.height / 2);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      crop.classList.add('dragging');\n      mode = 'br';\n      dragStart = { px: gr0.left + gr0.width / 2, py: gr0.top + gr0.height / 2, box: { x: box.x, y: box.y, w: box.w, h: box.h } };\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n        moveDrag(dragStart.px + dx * e, dragStart.py + dy * e);\n        var gr = br.getBoundingClientRect();\n        c.at(gr.left + gr.width / 2, gr.top + gr.height / 2);\n        if(t < 1){ rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step); }\n        else { mode = null; dragStart = null; crop.classList.remove('dragging'); c.release(); if(done) done(); }\n      }\n      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    reset();\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c) return;\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    dragBy(c, 18, 10, 620, function(){\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        resizeBy(c, 34, 22, 620, function(){\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            pressEl(c, applyBtn, function(){\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n                setTimeout(reset, 1200);\n              }, 500);\n            });\n          }, 500);\n        });\n      }, 320);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 7200); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  reset();\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){ paint(); });\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
  "createdAt": 1794680205765,
  "updatedAt": 1794685310471
}